WEBVTT

NOTE
The film carries a spoken narration and prints the same words on screen. These
cues are that narration, at the seconds it is spoken, published as text so a screen reader can
read it and a search engine can index it. The player does not switch them on by default: the
words are already in the picture, and a second copy would print every line twice.

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.450
Aextil Federal gives government
contractors one place to find, evaluate,

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.330
respond to, and follow up on federal
opportunities.

3
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.280
It learns your company from your
capabilities, past performance,

4
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:20.320
capability statements, preferences, and
information your team confirms.

5
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.810
It keeps everything organized and shows
where each fact came from.

6
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.530
As new opportunities appear,

7
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:32.710
Aextil compares each one to what your
company has actually done and is qualified

8
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.620
to do.

9
00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:38.390
It tells you what fits, what may be a
problem, and why.

10
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.380
When you choose to pursue one,

11
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.710
Aextil builds a draft using company
information and past performance your team

12
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.300
has approved.

13
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.330
If the Government asks something your
records cannot answer,

14
00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.560
Aextil asks your team instead of guessing
or leaving it out.

15
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:02.140
Your team reviews every answer, edits the
draft, changes the projects included,

16
00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.400
approves it, and sends it.

17
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.840
Aextil never sends anything to the
Government for you.

18
00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:13.320
Afterward, it keeps the pursuit and
follow-up organized.

19
00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.940
Aextil also learns from what you pursue
and pass on.

20
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.600
It can suggest updates to your
preferences,

21
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.380
but nothing changes unless you approve it.

22
00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.410
Federal opportunities move fast.

23
00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.630
Aextil Federal helps your team move
faster.
